    # "The date continues well after your devastating loss to Zemfira - something both girls make a fun point of teasing you about. You're not broken up - it's cute how they both smile when they do it."
    "Das Date läuft weiter gut nach deiner verheerenden Niederlage gegen Zemfira - etwas, worüber dich beide Mädchen lustig necken. Es macht dir nichts aus - es ist niedlich, wie beide lächeln, wenn sie es tun."

# game/code/book-2/chapter-12/s19_3.rpy:319
translate deutsch b2c12s19_3_continue_0020759d:

    # zp "-But {i}lately{/i} I've been going way more often. Just stress from school and the bar and all that, you know? Shooting is a great way to blow off steam."
