    # mc "I... appreciate the sentiment, girls. I'm just going my best, that's all."
    mc "Ich... weiß das zu schätzen, Mädels. Ich geb nur mein Bestes, das ist alles."

# game/code/book-2/chapter-12/s19_3.rpy:419
translate deutsch b2c12s19_3_ferries_wheel_ce7afff8:

    # nv "You're too modest! Seriously, you {i}kept{/i} having people come up to you to sing praises - you're a gift! And we couldn't be {i}more{/i} thankful for it."
